---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import brandmark from "../../assets/logo/lenz-brandmark-leather.jpg";
---

<section class="section section--light about-story">
  <div class="container about-story__inner">
    <div class="about-story__text">
      <p class="eyebrow">The LENZ Story</p>
      <div class="about-story__copy">
        <p>
          Sarah has spent more than twenty years behind a camera. What started as photography work
          eventually became LENZ — a studio built around doing this full time, and doing it well,
          rather than treating it as a side pursuit.
        </p>
        <p>
          Around 2019, that shifted into real estate and media photography as a full-time business.
          Listings needed to be shot on tight timelines and to a consistent standard, and that
          discipline — showing up, delivering fast, getting it right — became the foundation LENZ
          was built on.
        </p>
        <p>
          The work has since expanded well beyond real estate: commercial properties, branding and
          product photography, aerial coverage for construction and agriculture, and general
          business imagery. LENZ reflects that range — visual work for property, people, and
          business, rather than photography confined to one niche.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-story__brandmark">
      <Image src={brandmark} alt="The LENZ wordmark on a leather background" width={900} widths={[500, 700, 900]} sizes="(min-width: 55em) 30vw, 70vw" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-story__inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .about-story__copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1em;
    max-width: 42rem;
    font-size: var(--step-0);
    color: var(--color-charcoal);
  }

  .about-story__brandmark {
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
    max-width: 22rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgba(224, 176, 104, 0.16);
  }

  .about-story__brandmark :global(img) {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  @media (min-width: 55em) {
    .about-story__inner {
      flex-direction: row;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: var(--space-xl);
    }

    .about-story__text {
      flex: 1;
    }

    .about-story__brandmark {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      width: 22rem;
      max-width: 30vw;
    }
  }
</style>
